WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:27.480
The one most suitable as the
life unit for the Devil Gundam...

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:31.150
...is one who continues to give
birth to increase the number.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:32.610
Stop it!

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.360
You see, it requires...

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.570
...a woman.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:43.970
Now, everyone.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.540
This story refuses
to come to an end.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:52.040
After deciding to leave Domon...

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.560
...Rain was captured
by Ulube in order to...

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:57.970
...become the life force unit for
the Devil Gundam's resurrection.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.970
With full knowledge of
the risks involved...

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:05.490
...Domon has taken off into
space with Fuun Saiki...

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:07.840
...to rescue Rain.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.980
And now!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.810
Gundam Fight!

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.360
Ready! Go!

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:20.410
Devil Colony Activated!
Attack of the Shuffle Alliance

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.830
I call out to the entire fleet
and all Neo Japan citizens.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.750
<i>From this moment, we are at</i>
<i>wartime status, level one</i>.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:36.800
<i>All citizens are ordered to</i>
<i>evacuate to designated shelters!</i>

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.090
<i>Warning!</i>

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.560
<i>All citizens are ordered to</i>
<i>evacuate to designated shelters!</i>

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.530
From now on, I'll handle
everything on my own.

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:09.460
This is the moment of the true
resurrection of the Devil Gundam!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:20.340
What?!

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.430
Th-this is...

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:28.060
<i>Citizens of the universe</i>...

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.180
Ulube!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.520
<i>Yes</i>.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.650
<i>I am the great ruler of the</i>
<i>universe, Ulube Ishikawa!</i>

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:37.650
What's that man doing?!

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.190
Hey, what's going on?!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.820
D-don't ask me, I haven't a clue.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.780
<i>People!</i>

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:48.370
<i>It's known to everyone that</i>
<i>Neo Japan has in its grasp</i>...

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.740
...<i>the right to rule the universe</i>.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.080
<i>As a result, I am giving the</i>
<i>first order from our nation</i>.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.960
<i>I hereby declare the complete</i>
<i>abolishment of the Gundam Fight</i>.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.550
What'd he say?

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:02.800
But that would send Earth back
to the time of world wars!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.260
<i>There's no cause for alarm</i>.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.930
<i>After all, Neo Japan</i>
<i>will have the right</i>...

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.770
...<i>to rule the universe eternally</i>.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.770
<i>There's no longer a need</i>
<i>for the Gundam Fight</i>...

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.770
...<i>which is simply a</i>
<i>phony struggle for power</i>.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.650
That guy's completely
off his rocker.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.820
Hey, look.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.400
<i>Viewers, we have an update!</i>

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:26.820
<i>In response to Neo Japan's</i>
<i>military coup d'etat</i>...

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.700
...<i>the United Federation of Colonies</i>...

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.810
...<i>may be breaking their</i>
<i>cease-fire agreement</i>.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.160
<i>Also</i>...

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.170
...<i>Neo America has</i>
<i>taken the first step</i>...

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.590
...<i>by detaching their Manhattan</i>
<i>combat area to stage an attack</i>.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.590
Not that!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.390
Wh-what is that?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.390
Yeah.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.350
Neo America's most
advanced weapon.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.100
The Statue of Liberty Cannon!

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.690
Energy at full power!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.970
Fire!

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.830
Jesus!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:18.370
You think you can break through
our barrier with that power?

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.210
Don't make me laugh.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.390
My home!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.690
Rise! Devil Gundam!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.670
Th... this is...

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.370
I can't believe this is
happening to Neo Japan!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.670
Wh-what is that?!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.810
The world shall now
kneel before me.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.100
Forget it!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.480
As long as I have
the God Gundam...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.190
...I won't allow it!

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.980
I thought you'd be
coming, Domon Kasshu.

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:06.650
Or rather...

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:11.110
...the ultimate Fighter,
Gundam of Gundams!

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:14.400
But that title no
longer has any meaning.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.550
Everything's proceeding
according to my plan.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.880
Your feelings for your father...

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:36.050
...have been sufficient in bringing
out your abilities as a Fighter.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:37.310
Thank you.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.890
I owe it to you for allowing
me to get my hands on this.

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:42.480
You've been using me all along!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.230
You'll pay!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.230
So, what will you do?

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:47.900
It's pretty simple!

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.990
I'll destroy the Devil Gundam!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.280
Do you think it's possible?

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.780
Can you?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.000
Rain!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.800
Wong's research
deserves the credit!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.260
The Devil Gundam's
recovery is going well!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:18.140
Thanks to using a woman
for the life unit.

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:21.390
So, you did put Rain
in the Devil Gundam!

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.270
The fact that you two separated...

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:28.110
...was what finally allowed
me to complete my plans.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.320
Why, you!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:32.820
You took my father...

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.320
...my mother...

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:35.860
...my brother...

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:37.240
...Schwarz...

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.280
...and Master.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.990
And now...

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.660
...you even take Rain away!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.920
Ulube!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.630
I won't forgive you!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.250
I'll never forgive you!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.840
You sure have a lot of energy.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.840
But I wonder how long it'll last.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.940
He's finally resurrected the devil.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.770
That Ulube...

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:22.790
However, before my life
comes to an end...

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.240
I can't have it end like this.

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.420
This is really bad.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:36.010
People fear war may break out.
So they're all heading home.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.640
Don't they know they're up
against the Devil Gundam...

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.350
...and that it makes no
difference where you go?

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:46.680
But we can't just sit here
and do nothing about it!

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:48.020
Yes, but...

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.940
...Gundams cannot make it
through the atmosphere.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:54.570
It's just that Bro's out
there fighting alone!

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.190
Hey, you!

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:57.490
Aren't you from Neo Japan?!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:58.780
Do something about this!

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:01.390
Ulube's taken all of our shuttles.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.540
You're pathetic!

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:08.160
The crest on my right hand
is getting all worked up!

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.290
It's too early to call it quits!

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.510
This spaceship will make
it through the atmosphere.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.510
I know that ship!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.470
Yes.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.180
The ship used to transport
your friends to Earth.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.640
The Gorby 2.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.980
Captain Argo!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.190
Captain!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.980
Hurry, climb aboard!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.190
You guys!

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:37.860
It's a tough road ahead, right?

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.450
Then I'd say they're
the best we've got.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.820
Nastasha...

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.870
His handcuffs came right off!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.960
This'll free you up to fight
without any difficulty.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:57.930
Are you sure?

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.840
Unauthorized release of prisoners...

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.800
...is a serious crime.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.600
If it's an issue...

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.770
...I'll seriously consider joining
you and becoming a pirate.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.310
Let's go!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.190
To defeat the Devil Gundam!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.530
To space!

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:30.000
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.880
The nations of the world
avoided war by agreeing...

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.710
...to a Gundam Fight
held every four years.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.340
The winner earns the right
to rule the universe.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.180
How idiotic...

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.430
Fuun Saiki!

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:52.480
Ulube!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.020
What do you think you're doing?!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.730
What?

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.690
Just watch and you'll see.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:01.940
Yes. Just watch.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.410
That's all you need to do.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.870
Thinking back, I was the same.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.200
That day...

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:14.000
...I tried to capture the
Ultimate Gundam after it escaped.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.700
That's when I saw it.

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.590
Yes!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.300
It was clearly the devil!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.940
This was the only way
I could comprehend it.

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:38.310
In that moment he promised
to meet me again...

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:42.570
...with this red scar on
my face to seal our deal.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.700
I had no idea.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.080
I just went along with the
plan dreamed up by Ulube...

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.540
...to get my hands on the three
great theoretical abilities.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.420
I hereby appeal to the court!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:01.880
Dr. Kasshu must be sentenced to
an indefinite cryogenic state!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:05.220
We were successful in
silencing all witnesses.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.970
But who would've thought
it would come to this?

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.640
However...

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.390
...it was the Gundam Fight itself...

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.560
...that had fueled my ambitions.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:16.690
What do you mean?!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.940
You see...

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.520
...I, too, was once
a Gundam Fighter!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:21.730
What?!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:26.700
I'll never forget the 12th Gundam
Fight Tournament four years ago.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.910
I was known to everyone
as the Genius Fighter.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.120
I fought and fought...

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.580
...and continued fighting!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.660
I made it to the
Tournament Finals...

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.870
...and was about to
fight my last bout!

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.510
But all that remained was
defeat and humiliation.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.220
And it became so clear to me.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.970
That power is what
rules this universe!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.730
Although the Gundam Fight was
created to eliminate wars...

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.440
...it is still a battle of
strength among nations.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.690
The weak are defeated
by the strong.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:08.030
It is the ultimate truth which
applies to the whole universe.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.820
And I have finally
made it my own!

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:15.830
This great power that materialized
into a shape and form!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:17.910
You!

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:19.330
Now, take a look...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.580
...at this power!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:33.140
You have been a great
source of amusement to me.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.120
What?!

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:37.350
The only school that I've lost to...

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.060
...is the Undefeated of the East.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.230
What a coincidence...

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:43.310
...observing a furious
battle this past year...

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:44.570
...between the Master and
the pupil who hated him.

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:47.150
It was quite a lot of fun.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.110
You bastard!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:53.120
And now his own father's theories
will ensure his defeat...

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:56.290
...with the use of the body that
belongs to the one he loves.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.870
Don't you find it ironic?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.290
Don't you touch Rain!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:03.460
Shut up!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.380
It's no use.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.300
Having lost Rain, you cannot win.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.600
You shall fall into eternal sleep...

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.140
...along with Rain.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.730
Rain!

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:21.690
Rain!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:24.360
Rain!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.120
Hey, Domon...

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.460
Have you thought about what'll
happen after the year's over?

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.880
If you win the Gundam Fight...

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.680
Dr. Kasshu will be freed
from his cryogenic state.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:56.510
Then I suppose there would be
no reason for us to be together.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:01.100
Being together like this
will become a mere memory...

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.310
...and disappear into the past.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.270
Don't be silly.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:11.920
Rain?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:13.700
Rain!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.950
Where did you go?

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:17.950
Rain! Rain!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:19.160
Rain!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.910
Where did you go, Rain?

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.420
Rain!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.960
Rain!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.990
Rain!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.800
Now! Your dream
is about to end!

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:44.810
What?!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.770
What's going on?!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:50.820
That ship...

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:56.820
The Shuffle Alliance
has gathered as one!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.590
We figured you wouldn't
get far all by yourself.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:01.720
That's right!

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.080
The Shuffle Alliance
consists of five!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.620
This is more like it!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.210
All right! Let's
go and rescue Rain!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:09.920
You guys...

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.170
That's right!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.920
We come from different nations,
but our objectives are the same!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.230
And it is you who have
brought our hearts together.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.390
Our true battle begins now!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:26.310
Ring the bell, Domon Kasshu!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.520
Right!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:29.650
Gundam Fight!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.610
Ready! Go!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:37.570
Come take me on, Shuffle Alliance!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.610
Rose Bits!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.300
Take this!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.730
Don't get too close!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.440
Then what are we supposed to do?!

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.030
There you go.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.530
Face it, your efforts
won't make any difference.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.760
You're all powerless,
Gundam Fighters!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.330
No. There's still a way.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:30.790
I know that voice.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:35.260
It's impossible to defeat
this devil from the outside.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.260
Yes.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.720
This cursed thing has
but one weak point.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:44.810
You must be able to get inside
and attack it from within.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.520
Dr. Mikamura?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:49.480
You're still alive.
Damn, Mikamura.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.520
What difference can
a doomed man make?

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.070
He's not serious!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.780
Damn! I didn't think about that!

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.450
Listen...

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:09.370
I'm about to release Dr. Kasshu.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:10.750
My father?!

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:15.460
To you and your father, I am
a man beyond forgiveness.

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:18.130
I am truly sorry.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.430
And though I realize I'm in no
position to ask for a favor...

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:24.780
...please.

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:28.640
Please, save my daughter!

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:31.100
She has done nothing wrong.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.310
I'm responsible for all of this!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:39.570
D-Dr. Mikamura...

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.530
Don't let him get close to us!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.080
No, Doctor!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.290
Domon Kasshu!

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:55.000
The professor will break open
that section so you can enter!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.660
We'll provide cover!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.960
Move in as close as you can!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.260
Right now is not the time
for you to get emotional!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.470
Right...

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.390
Open all gun turrets!

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.810
Give the Shuffle Alliance cover!

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:24.160
I don't think I'll have a chance
to see my daughter again.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.780
Please tell her for me...

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.790
...that I am truly sorry.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.250
Hey, old friend...

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.550
As you lie there sleeping
in that cryogenic state...

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.220
...what do you think of me?

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.690
Are you laughing at me
for being such a fool?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:48.680
Or...?

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.760
As it turns out, I
couldn't win against you...

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.560
...right until the very end.

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:12.540
That's...!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.290
Father!

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.420
Father!

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.250
Wait, Domon!

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:22.210
Nastasha will recover
your father's capsule!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:26.050
You have to focus on defeating
the Devil Gundam right now!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.850
Don't forget there's one
other person waiting for you!

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.050
That's right!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.930
We have to go rescue Rain!

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.390
Father...

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.320
Okay!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:51.240
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:57.460
Its loud roar tells
me to rescue my Rain!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.300
Erupting...

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:08.300
...God Finger!

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:10.010
Wait for me!

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:13.310
Father! Rain!

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.820
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.670
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:43.800
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:54.180
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.430 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:09.860
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:17.330
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:26.170
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:35.760
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:37.970
As Domon and the others
head for Rain...

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:40.940
...the four kings of the Devil
Gundam push them to the limit.

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:45.940
However, Gundams are gathering
from around the world!

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:50.490
The Fighters join forces to
stage an attack on the devil!

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:52.570
Next, on Mobile
Fighter G Gundam...

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:56.740
Earth's SOS!
Gundam Federation Rescue.

00:23:54.370 --> 00:24:00.740
Earth's SOS!
Gundam Federation Rescue

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:59.120
Ready! Go!
